<p><%= mail_greeting %></p>
<p>An email from <%= @current_account.name %> could not be sent through your account’s email server.</p>
<p>
  Message: <%= @kind %><br>
  To: <%= @recipients.join(', ') %><br>
  When: <%= @failed_at %><br>
  Reason: <%= @reason %>
</p>
<p>EsignCenter will keep retrying queued messages. Please check your SMTP settings so your emails can reach their recipients.</p>
<p><%= link_to 'Review your email settings', @settings_url %> to fix the connection, or remove the settings to use EsignCenter’s email server.</p>
<p>We send this notice at most once every 24 hours. You can also see the latest failure on the Email SMTP settings page.</p>
<p>Thanks,<br>EsignCenter</p>
